  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "pull nearby enemies to center, dealing damage and immobilizing",
    "skill1": "AoE dual-sword attack reducing enemy haste and magic DEF",
    "skill2": "large personal shield, granting high dodge rate",
    "skill3": "ranged DEF scales up when health is low",
    "skill4": "cast ultimate on any tile at battle start",
    "skill5": "extra magic DEF reduction on immobilized targets"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Eironn]] can cast his ultimate on any tile at battle start, pulling nearby enemies together for damage and immobilization. His dual-sword sweep reduces enemy Haste and Magic DEF, while a high-dodge shield protects him when pressured. Ranged defense rises at low HP, and immobilized targets take additional Magic DEF reduction. He is a premier opener for control and Magic-damage teams. Pull-immune or Unaffected targets sharply reduce his opening value.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Eironn]] threatens a battle-start pull that groups your line for Magic damage and immobilize chains. Answer on the same opening beat with [[Lily May]]; [[Pandora]] is too slow for this window. Blunt the displacement with [[filter:steadfast]] like [[Igor]] or [[Gunnar]], and separately use [[filter:unaffected]] like [[Callan]] on the opening beat. If the pull connects, punish the clustered follow-up with lasting coverage like [[Shemira]] or [[Gwyneth]]."
